Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:57.06,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}A sunny Sunday's early afternoon;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:21:00.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:06.82,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}The same old road that I'm so used to walking on...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:11.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...shines with a dazzling light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:16.54,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I have the warm sunlight shining down on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:21.84,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...and you by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:31.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My feelings are ready to burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:37.06,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:42.28,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:47.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:53.12,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:57.50,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.92,0:22:03.42,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice swoops up and down with me.
